WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.046
Mayor Bloom sat in his office at City Hall.

2
00:00:08.047 --> 00:00:13.328
His phone rang.

3
00:00:13.329 --> 00:00:16.398
"It's time," said a voice on the phone.

4
00:00:16.399 --> 00:00:20.101
"Yes, boss," said Mayor Bloom.

5
00:00:20.102 --> 00:00:27.495
He hung up the phone.

6
00:00:27.496 --> 00:00:31.193
The mayor went into another room and opened a safe.

7
00:00:31.194 --> 00:00:33.689
He pulled out a bunch of money.

8
00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:37.435
"Mayor Bloom," said the mayor's assistant.

9
00:00:37.436 --> 00:00:39.203
"What are you doing?

10
00:00:39.204 --> 00:00:43.000
That's the money for the new playground in Metro City Park."

11
00:00:43.001 --> 00:00:45.238
Mayor Bloom didn't say anything.

12
00:00:45.239 --> 00:00:51.887
He stuffed the money into a briefcase and ran.

13
00:00:51.888 --> 00:00:56.615
"I hope the new playground has a really big fort," said Jack.

14
00:00:56.616 --> 00:01:00.167
"With bridges, ladders, slides, and tunnels!"

15
00:01:00.168 --> 00:01:03.987
Roxy and her friends were at Metro City Park.

16
00:01:03.988 --> 00:01:07.547
They were standing in an open area filled with weeds.

17
00:01:07.548 --> 00:01:10.179
It was where the new playground would be soon.

18
00:01:10.180 --> 00:01:14.099
"I hope the playground has a tower!" said Terrell.

19
00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:17.604
"I want a swing set," said Roxy.

20
00:01:17.605 --> 00:01:21.356
"Swinging makes me feel like I can fly."

21
00:01:21.357 --> 00:01:24.505
Terrell gave her a suspicious look.

22
00:01:24.506 --> 00:01:28.415
"I hope they build the playground soon," said Mara.

23
00:01:28.416 --> 00:01:31.299
"I'm tired of waiting for it."

24
00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:35.641
"We should get Rocket Girl to build the playground," said Terrell.

25
00:01:35.642 --> 00:01:39.054
"She could build it really fast."

26
00:01:39.055 --> 00:01:41.783
Roxy rolled her eyes.

27
00:01:41.784 --> 00:01:45.773
"I think Rocket Girl has more important things to do."

28
00:01:45.774 --> 00:01:49.905
Terrell sighed. "You're right," he said.

29
00:01:49.906 --> 00:01:52.260
Suddenly his eyes lit up.

30
00:01:52.261 --> 00:01:55.666
"You know what would be really cool?" he asked.

31
00:01:55.667 --> 00:01:58.133
"What?" asked Jack.

32
00:01:58.134 --> 00:02:02.611
"If there were two Rocket Girls!" said Terrell.

33
00:02:02.612 --> 00:02:08.186
"One could fight super villains, and the other could build our playground!"

34
00:02:08.187 --> 00:02:11.474
Everyone laughed.

35
00:02:11.475 --> 00:02:13.863
Roxy shook her head.

36
00:02:13.864 --> 00:02:19.109
"Terrell, that is the silliest thing I ever heard in my entire life."

37
00:02:19.110 --> 00:02:24.988
Terrell shrugged. "I'm just saying . . . It would be cool."

38
00:02:24.989 --> 00:02:29.594
Just then Roxy's wristwatch beeped quietly.

39
00:02:29.595 --> 00:02:36.825
Roxy walked away from her friends.

40
00:02:36.826 --> 00:02:40.068
She pressed a button on her watch.

41
00:02:40.069 --> 00:02:44.297
Detective Smith's face appeared on the screen.

42
00:02:44.298 --> 00:02:46.944
"Uh-oh!" thought Roxy.

43
00:02:46.945 --> 00:02:50.172
"Detective Smith doesn't know who I really am!"

44
00:02:50.173 --> 00:02:53.104
Roxy quickly put on her mask.

45
00:02:53.105 --> 00:02:55.875
"Detective Smith," she whispered.

46
00:02:55.876 --> 00:02:59.496
"What's going on? Where's Mayor Bloom?"

47
00:02:59.497 --> 00:03:02.399
Detective Smith cleared his throat.

48
00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:04.974
"We have a problem, Rocket Girl.

49
00:03:04.975 --> 00:03:11.320
It looks like Mayor Bloom stole the money for the new playground at Metro City Park."

50
00:03:11.321 --> 00:03:13.399
Roxy was shocked.

51
00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:16.099
"No way," she said.

52
00:03:16.100 --> 00:03:18.886
"Mayor Bloom would never do that."

53
00:03:18.887 --> 00:03:22.704
"I know it's hard to believe," said Detective Smith.

54
00:03:22.705 --> 00:03:25.320
"But his assistant saw him do it.

55
00:03:25.321 --> 00:03:28.458
I need you to come down to City Hall right away."

56
00:03:28.459 --> 00:03:37.244
Roxy gulped. "Okay, Detective. I'll be right there."

